00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:21.308
or things of that nature,

00:07:21.308 --> 00:07:22.809
like self-awareness 
is imperative.

00:07:22.809 --> 00:07:25.578
And as an operator, 
I'm very self-aware

00:07:25.578 --> 00:07:28.315
