good at everything.

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:40.193
And that's super real.

00:07:40.193 --> 00:07:41.161
And I think we all know that.

00:07:41.161 --> 00:07:43.363
And we have strengths and
weaknesses and I think,

00:07:43.363 --> 00:07:44.664
I've been a guy,

00:07:44.664 --> 00:07:48.134
