down in your strengths.

00:07:51.237 --> 00:07:54.474
I do not, I'm not a big fan
on working on your weaknesses.

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:57.844
I think you have to be
dangerous in your weaknesses,

00:07:57.844 --> 00:08:01.147
like I'm not a dope when
it comes to the finances

00:08:01.147 --> 00:08:03.083
or the other things 
that I don't wanna do,

00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:05.118
but I'm far from 
being interested

00:08:05.118 --> 00:08:07.153
in being world-class in it,

00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:08.088
It just doesn't leave 
enough room

00:08:08.088 --> 00:08:10.357
for you to be world-class at
what comes natural to you,

00:08:10.357 --> 00:08:13.360
which is always 
gonna have more upside.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:15.428
So, it's been AJ, 
it's gonna be James,

00:08:15.428 --> 00:08:16.463
I'm building something else,

00:08:16.463 --> 00:08:18.398
I don't know, I'm sure
a lot of you that have

00:08:18.398 --> 00:08:20.567
bigger organizations if you're
not in a solo entrepreneur

00:08:20.567 --> 00:08:22.602
land and if you've 
run companies,

00:08:22.602 --> 00:08:24.404
one of the things that 
I realize and I realize I did at

00:08:24.404 --> 00:08:27.207
Wine Library and I'm gonna make
it official at VaynerMedia,

00:08:27.207 --> 00:08:31.678
is I'm gonna create something
called Office of the CEO.

00:08:31.678 --> 00:08:34.814
So there's gonna be these six
people and they're my family,

00:08:34.814 --> 00:08:36.449
